Subject: [PATCH 07/19] opt: AdamW (weight decay 0, identical to the previous
 Adam) in all trainers; optional Muon on hidden Linear weights

AdamW with weight_decay 0.0 is numerically identical to Adam (test: 25 fresh steps and 10 steps after resuming an Adam
checkpoint, max parameter difference 0.0); it is the base for later weight-decay experiments. hidden_optimizer=muon
(wm_trainer / policy_trainer) mirrors the official release: Muon on the Linear weights between the first and the last
Linear of each Sequential, AdamW elsewhere. Resuming an Adam checkpoint with the Muon layout starts the optimizer fresh.
